<title>UK: Magnum Power says in AIM refinancing talks.</title>
<headline>Magnum Power says in AIM refinancing talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magnum Power Plc said on Thursday it is in discussions concerning a refinancing on the Alternative Invesment Market and expects to make a full announcement soon.</p>
<p>The company was responding in a statement to share price moves in trading which saw the stock down three pence to a year low of 21-1/2 pence at 1254 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
